Assembly test programs for PolkaVM recorder.

These programs are constructed programmatically using polkavm-common's
ProgramBlobBuilder in the test code (tests/test_tracer.rs), avoiding
the need for a RISC-V cross-compilation toolchain in CI.

The ProgramBlobBuilder API allows us to specify PolkaVM instructions
directly and produce a valid ProgramBlob that can be loaded and
executed by the PolkaVM engine.
